flowchart TD
Start([User runs CLI / git ai]) --> Check{Staged Changes Exist?}



Check -->|No| Warn[Display Warning: Run `git add` first] --> End([Exit])
Check -->|Yes| Extract[1. Git Diff Extractor]
Extract --> Sanitize[2. Sanitizer & Token Manager]
Sanitize -->|Filter lockfiles, check size/secrets| BuildPrompt[3. Prompt Builder]
BuildPrompt --> CallLLM[4. LLM Provider <br><i>Local Ollama / API</i>]
CallLLM --> Present[5. Action & Presentation Layer]
Present --> Choice{User Decision?}
Choice -->|Accept [Y]| Commit[Execute `git commit -m "..."`] --> Success([Commit Created!])
Choice -->|Edit [E]| OpenEditor[Open `$EDITOR` with suggestion] --> Commit
Choice -->|Reject [N]| Abort([Operation Aborted])
